@startuml overview
' One-glance map of the system. Start here.
title Intelligent ERP — How the system fits together

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #55606E
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #9AA5B1
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FB
}

actor "User\n(admin · manager · employee)" as user

rectangle "**React app**\nbrowser" as front #E8F4EE

rectangle "**Laravel API**\nbusiness rules + database" as api #E8F0FA

rectangle "**AI service**\nassistant" as ai #F3EBFA

database "**PostgreSQL**" as db #FDF3E3

rectangle "**Ollama**\nlocal AI model" as llm #FAECEC

user --> front
front --> api : REST + JWT
api --> db
api --> ai : chat questions
ai --> llm : thinks
ai --> api : acts through the same API,\nsigned in as the user

note bottom of ai
  The assistant has no database access.
  It uses the same API a person uses,
  so permissions apply to it too.
end note

@enduml
